{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2022-11-01 12:41:00', 'title': "EQT AWARDED GOLD STANDARD RATING BY UNITED NATIONS' OIL & GAS METHANE PARTNERSHIP", 'text': 'RECOGNIZED FOR LEADING METHANE REDUCTIONS PROGRAM AND SETTING AMBITIOUS EMISSIONS REDUCTION TARGETS\xa0\xa0 PITTSBURGH , NOV. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQT CORPORATION (NYSE: EQT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE OIL & GAS METHANE PARTNERSHIP 2.0 (OGMP 2.0) AWARDED THE COMPANY A "GOLD STANDARD" RATING, THE HIGHEST REPORTING LEVEL UNDER THE INITIATIVE, IN RECOGNITION OF EQT\'S AMBITIOUS METHANE EMISSIONS REDUCTION TARGETS AND ADVANCED COMMITMENT TO ACCURATELY MEASURING, REPORTING AND REDUCING ITS COMPANY-SPECIFIC AND SITE LEVEL METHANE EMISSIONS.\xa0 OGMP 2.0 IS A MULTI-STAKEHOLDER INITIATIVE LAUNCHED BY THE UNITED NATIONS ENVIRONMENT PROGRAMME AND THE CLIMATE AND CLEAN AIR COALITION IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION, THE U.K. AND NORWEGIAN GOVERNMENTS, THE ENVIRONMENTAL DEFENSE FUND AND NEARLY 80 LEADING OIL AND GAS COMPANIES.'}